food and firewood dear","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"475a244b-bb11-4219-9566-77e5acbfa2ef","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1100.0,"yMin":1020.0,"xMax":1520.0,"yMax":1140.0},"title":"epidemic","body":"sickness: fewer hands, a little dearer","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"2a428d35-65f0-44ba-803d-6cd137c3d7a6","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1100.0,"yMin":1190.0,"xMax":1520.0,"yMax":1310.0},"title":"fair","body":"a fair: buyers come, prices up","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"bdcee596-4b14-495e-8ddb-77ed6df44e5b","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":0.0,"yMin":340.0,"xMax":640.0,"yMax":500.0},"title":"To come","body":"Wars and campaigns closing routes (the sea lanes), raiders taking ships (the AI''s raiders), laws by year (already in trade_rules), news of the event travelling port to port (who knows, and when).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"06e418fb-c336-48ac-bba9-81df34813b5e","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
